.so`s and both executables. Both sides always reached via `dlopen`+`dlsym`.\n- **C** — all 18 `ERRORS.md` rows pass (empty/closed/directory/write-only stdin, closed stdout, `/dev/full`, `CHAR_MAX` overflow → `ffffff80`, NUL, whitespace-not-skipped, 1 MiB input, wide-int args, exit status always 0, plus null-pointer N/A justified from the C declarations).\n- **D** — `nm -D` diff is **empty** in both dev and release; suite green under `--no-default-features`, `--features default`, plain default, and `--release` (`./verify.sh` → `ALL CHECKS PASSED`, 47 tests × 4 configs).\n\n**Anti-vacuity evidence:** 6 injected mutations (dropped zero-padding, dropped sign-extension, wrong `+1` wrap, ignored EOF, ignored FFI arg, whitespace skipping) were each caught and then reverted — sources verified byte-identical afterward. Zero divergences were found in the translation itself."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1210,"cache_read_input_tokens":143516,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1210,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ab6f0900-f200-4634-949e-8eacec751298","uuid":"0ad226d3-61b0-4b66-aef3-edc313c006ae","timestamp":"2026-08-18T00:47:31.779Z"}
